# DIT-OS bootloader

Before editing matching files, read `.agents/skills/bootloader/SKILL.md` and follow
it. Also apply `AGENTS.md` (definition of done, handoff, hard rules) and the
mandatory `.agents/skills/security-audit/SKILL.md` for every code change.
Content lives in the skill; this file only points to it.

Never forget:
- Disk layout numbers must change in every file listed in the skill.
- C++ files in src/stage2/ and src/uefi/ are dead code (ISSUES.md H18).
- Check the BIOS carry flag after every int 0x13; bound every ELF field.
